 "remarks": "Welcome to 85 Camp Avenue in Stamford's vibrant and charming Springdale neighborhood! This spacious 2-bedroom, 1.5-bath townhouse offers a versatile layout with a large loft, perfect for a home office, guest space, playroom, or additional living area. Enjoy the convenience of being within walking distance of the Springdale train station, along with a great selection of restaurants, shops, and everyday conveniences. Located in a wonderful community offering an outdoor pool, clubhouse, and fitness center, this home combines comfort, convenience, and low-maintenance living. A fantastic opportunity to enjoy everything Springdale has to offer, with easy access to transportation, dining, and shopping!",
